nfig_silent_skip` | BACKEND_URL 为空，所有调用静默跳过（return 0/1 但无输出） |\n| `test_backend_available_timeout` | 连接不可达端口，2 秒内返回失败 |\n| `test_call_backend_timeout` | 连接不可达端口，5 秒内返回空 |\n\n**实现方式**：纯 bash 脚本，source backend.sh 后直接调用函数并检查返回码和耗时。\n\n### Step 3: 标记需求文档 checkbox\n\n文件：`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/backend-infrastructure.md`\n\n将所有 `- [ ]` 改为 `- [x]`。\n\n## 涉及文件\n\n| 操作 | 文件 |\n|------|------|\n| 新建 | `claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/b7_infrastructure_test.go` |\n| 新建 | `claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/test_b7_backend_sh.sh` |\n| 修改 | `doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/backend-infrastructure.md` |\n\n## 验证\n\n```bash\ncd claude_tap_plus\ngo test ./tests/backend/... -run TestB7_ -v -count=1   # Go 测试\nbash tests/shell/test_b7_backend_sh.sh                   # Shell 测试\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_ee2978023b16484d9d05cbb7","tool_response":"File created successfully at: C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\plans\\noble-wandering-pearl.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
