ckend.conf missing or backend unreachable\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/b7_infrastructure_test.go` (NEW - 9 tests)\n     - Tests B7 acceptance criteria: /health endpoint, auto table creation, config defaults, CLI flag parsing, connection refused, WAL mode, session table schema\n     - Final version uses `fmt.Sscanf` for port parsing in `parseBackendFlags` helper\n     - All 9 tests PASS\n\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/b7_backend_sh_test.sh` (NEW - 7 tests)\n     - Tests shell-side B7: source success, no-config silent skip, _backend_available 2s timeout, _call_backend 5s timeout, _status_to_label mapping, _get_session_id, /health with backend\n     - All 7 tests PASS (with running backend)\n\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/backend/b4_status_api_test.go` (NEW - 7 tests + 6 subtests)\n     - Tests B4 acceptance: updated_at auto-refresh, full status transition chain (claimed→merged), reject chain, previous_status in response, nonexistent issue, non-owner blocked across all statuses, method not allowed\n     - Uses dual time.Parse: `time.RFC3339` first, fallback to `\"2006-01-02 15:04:05\"`\n     - All 7 tests PASS\n\n   - `claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/b6_2_skill_integration_test.sh` (NEW - being fixed)\n     - Tests B6-2 acceptance: backend down silent skip, no config silent skip, session_id, status-to-label mapping, sync_github_label doesn't crash, full backend-up status flow (merge + reject)\n     - Key fix: backend-up tests use `_update_status()` helper that calls `_call_backend` directly instead of `update_issue_status` (which requires `gh` command)\n     - Helper functions `_update_status` and `_check_status` added for direct backend API calls\n\n   - `doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/backend-infrastructure.md`\n     - All 10 checkboxes marked `[x]` (B7 completed)\n\n   - `doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/issue-status-api.md`\n     - 5/6 checkboxes marked `[x]`, `invalid_transition` kept as `[ ]` (o