[2026-05-30 11:01:53] [INFO] [Stop] Input: {"session_id":"05f8cfed-d555-49d3-9c73-101e07a3c913","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\d--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\05f8cfed-d555-49d3-9c73-101e07a3c913.jsonl","cwd":"d:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"Stop","stop_hook_active":false,"last_assistant_message":"这段代码的作用：**从 `.git/config` 文件中提取 git 仓库名称**。\n\n比如一个 `.git/config` 长这样：\n\n```ini\n[core]\n    repositoryformatversion = 0\n[remote \"origin\"]\n    url = https://github.com/user/claude-hk.git\n    fetch = +refs/heads/*:refs/remotes/origin/*\n[branch \"main\"]\n    remote = origin\n```\n\n函数会解析出 `claude-hk`。\n\n逐行解释：\n\n```go\nfunc gitRemoteRepoName(dir string) string {\n\n    // 拼接路径：dir/.git/config\n    configPath := filepath.Join(dir, \".git\", \"config\")\n\n    // 读取整个文件内容\n    data, err := os.ReadFile(configPath)\n    if err != nil {\n        return \"\"    // 读不到就返回空串\n    }\n\n    // byte[] → string\n    content := string(data)\n\n    // 按换行符拆成行数组\n    lines := strings.Split(content, \"\\n\")\n\n    // 标记：是否在 [remote \"origin\"] 区域内\n    inOrigin := false\n\n    // 逐行扫描\n    for _, line := range lines {\n        trimmed := strings.TrimSpace(line)  // 去掉首尾空白\n\n        // 1. 找到 [remote \"origin\"] 这一行\n        if trimmed == `[remote \"origin\"]` {\n            inOrigin = true\n            continue\n        }\n\n        // 2. 在 origin 区域内，找 url = xxx\n        if inOrigin && strings.HasPrefix(trimmed, \"url = \") {\n            url := strings.TrimPrefix(trimmed, \"url = \")\n            // url = \"https://github.com/user/claude-hk.git\"\n\n            // 取最后一段路径 → \"claude-hk.git\"\n            base := filepath.Base(url)\n\n            // 去掉 .git 后缀 → \"claude-hk\"\n            base = strings.TrimSuffix(base, \".git\")\n            return base\n        }\n\n        // 3. 遇到下一个 [xxx] 区域，说明 origin 区结束了\n        if inOrigin && strings.HasPrefix(trimmed, \"[\") {\n            break\n        }\n    }\n\n    return \"\"    // 没找到就返回空串\n}\n```\n\n执行过程：\n\n```\n输入：dir = \"d:/CodeDevelopment/CodeProject/claude-hk\"\n\n读取 .git/config → 逐行扫描\n    ↓\n找到 [remote \"origin\"]  → inOrigin = true\n    ↓\n找到 url = https://github.com/user/claude-hk.git\n    ↓\nfilepath.Base() → \"claude-hk.git\"\n    ↓\nTrimSuffix(\".git\") → \"claude-hk\"\n    ↓\n返回 \"claude-hk\"\n```\n\n简单说：**解析 git 配置文件，拿到仓库名**。这样 trace 文件就能按仓库名归类记录。","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}
