.claude/hooks/29-session-end/base.sh`** (MODIFIED - added unregister_session)\n     - Added `unregister_session()` function after `release_session_issues`:\n     ```bash\n     unregister_session() {\n       local sid reason\n       sid=$(json_get '.session_id')\n       reason=$(json_get '.reason')\n       [ -z \"$sid\" ] && return 0\n       source \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/skills/backend.sh\"\n       _load_backend_url\n       [ -z \"$BACKEND_URL\" ] && return 0\n       if ! _backend_available; then\n         log \"DEBUG\" \"Backend unreachable, skipping session close for $sid\"\n         return 0\n       fi\n       _call_backend \"/api/session/close\" \"{\\\"session_id\\\":\\\"$sid\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"$reason\\\"}\" > /dev/null 2>&1\n       log \"INFO\" \"Session unregistered from backend: $sid\"\n     }\n     unregister_session\n     ```\n\n   - **`claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/sr2_session_register_test.sh`** (NEW - 5 tests)\n     - Tests: backend down silent, no conf silent, register with all 8 fields, source startup vs resume, duplicate register no crash\n\n   - **`claude_tap_plus/tests/shell/sr3_session_unregister_test.sh`** (NEW - 5 tests)\n     - Tests: backend down silent, no conf silent, close sets closed, close records reason and time, no close keeps active\n\n   - **`claude_tap_plus/tests/integration/sr5_integration_test.go`** (NEW - 6 tests)\n     - Import uses underscore: `github.com/liaohch3/claude-tap/claude_tap_plus/internal/backend/...`\n     - Tests: register creates machine/project, multiple sessions same machine (machine dedup), end-to-end session with issue ops, state preserved across restart, duplicate register 409, session list filters\n\n   - **`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/requirement-queue.md`** (MODIFIED)\n     - Marked B6-2 ✅, B6-1 ✅, B8 ✅, SR-2 ✅, SR-3 ✅, SR-5 ✅\n\n   - **`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/skill-refactor/fix-to-review-skills.md`** (MODIFIED) - 6 checkboxes marked [x]\n   - **`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/skill-refactor/claim-skill.md`** (MODIFIED) - 5 checkboxes marked [x]\n   - **`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/issue-management-reqs/degradation-strategy.md`** (MODIFIED) - 6 checkboxes marked [x]\n   - **`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/claude-tap-plus-session-subreqs/sr2-session-start-register.md`** (MODIFIED) - 5 checkboxes marked [x]\n   - **`doc/otherDoc/2026-05-27/claude-tap-plus-session-subreqs/sr3-session-end-unregister.md`** (MODIFIED) - 5 checkboxes marked [x]\n\n   - **`claude_tap_plus/internal/proxy/reverse.go`** (READ - for user's question about original message recording)\n     - `buildRecord()` already captures full request/response bodies, headers, SSE events in JSONL trace\n     - Request body is in `record[\"request\"][\"body\"]`, response body in `record[\"response\"][\"body\"]`\n\n   - **`claude_tap_plus/internal/trace/writer.go`** (READ - for user's question)\n     - `TraceWriter.Write()` serializes full record as JSONL\n     - `updateStats()` extracts model/usage from records\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **B6-1 sourcing claim script**: `03UserPromptSubmit.sh` executes `gh` commands at source time (lines 88-127), causing tests to hang/fail. Fixed by NOT sourcing the claim script and instead testing `backend.sh` functions directly.\n   - **B6-1 backend-up tests skipped**: The main section called `run_test \"test_...\" test_func` without passing `$BACKEND_URL_ARG`. Fixed by adding conditional logic similar to b6_2 pattern.\n   - **SR-5 import path**: Used `claude-tap-plus` (hyphen) instead of `claude_tap_plus` (underscore) in import. Fixed by using correct underscore path.\n   - **SR-5 missing import**: `database/sql` not imported, causing `undefined: sql` error. Fixed by adding to imports.\n   - **SR-5 `:=` vs `=`**: Line 360 used `resp, err :=` but `resp` was already declared. Fixed to `resp, _ =`.\n   - **Lingering backend processes**: Backend processes on ports 18080-18084 weren't killed after tests. User explicitly asked \"你是不是又启动的后端程序忘了关闭了\". K