n\n**Child process env vars built in:**\n```go\nchildEnv := config.BuildChildEnv(&config.ClaudeClient, proxyURL)\n```\n\n**Exit summary format:**\n```go\nsummary := rp.Summary()\nfmt.Printf(\"\\n📋 Claude Code exited\")\nif waitErr != nil {\n    fmt.Printf(\" with error: %v\", waitErr)\n}\nfmt.Printf(\"\\n\")\nfmt.Printf(\"   API calls:      %v\\n\", summary[\"api_calls\"])\nfmt.Printf(\"   Input tokens:    %v\\n\", summary[\"input_tokens\"])\nfmt.Printf(\"   Output tokens:   %v\\n\", summary[\"output_tokens\"])\nfmt.Printf(\"   Cache read:      %v\\n\", summary[\"cache_read_tokens\"])\nfmt.Printf(\"   Cache create:    %v\\n\", summary[\"cache_create_tokens\"])\nfmt.Printf(\"   Trace: %s\\n\", tapOutputDir)\n```\n\n## 2. Config Detection\n\n**Function signature:**\n```go\nfunc DetectTarget(cfg *ClientConfig) string\n```\n\n**BuildChildEnv function signature:**\n```go\nfunc BuildChildEnv(cfg *ClientConfig, proxyURL string) []string\n```\n\n**Env var handling:**\n- Clears nesting keys: `CLAUDECODE`, `CLAUDE_CODE_SSE_PORT`\n- Sets base URL env var: `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`\n- Injects settings for Claude Code if needed\n\n## 3. Existing Config File Reading\n\n**File path:** `~/.claude.json`\n\n**Struct:**\n```go\ntype ClaudeConfig struct {\n    BaseURL string `json:\"base_url,omitempty\"`\n    Env     struct {\n        AnthropicBaseURL string `json:\"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL,omitempty\"`\n    } `json:\"env,omitempty\"`\n}\n```\n\n**Priority order:**\n1. Environment variable `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`\n2. `~/.claude.json` → `env.ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` → `base_url`\n3. Default target: `https://api.anthropic.com`\n\n## 4. Logger Console Control\n\n**Function signature:**\n```go\nfunc Init(dir string, consoleEnabled bool, level Level) error\n```\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `dir`: Log file directory\n- `consoleEnabled`: Whether to also output to stderr (only INFO and above)\n- `level`: Minimum log level (DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR)\n\n**Usage in proxy mode:**\n```go\nif tapVerbose {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, true, logger.DEBUG)\n} else {\n    logger.Init(tapOutputDir, false, logger.INFO)\n}\n```\n\n## 5. Trace Path / Session ID\n\n**Session ID extraction:**\n```go\nfunc extractSessionID(reqBody any) string {\n    // Extracts from request.body.metadata.user_id\n    // Format: \"{\\\"session_id\\\": \\\"uuid\\\", ...}\"\n}\n```\n\n**Trace path generation:**\n1. **Default format:** `baseDir/{project}/{date}_{time}_{shortID}.jsonl`\n   - Project detected from git remote or cwd name\n   - Date format: `2006-01-02_150405`\n   - 3-byte random ID for uniqueness\n\n2. **Session format:** `baseDir/{machineID}/{projectSlug}/{sessionID}.jsonl`\n   - Machine ID: `username@hostname`\n   - Project slug extracted from transcript path\n   - Session ID from request\n\n**Storage locations:**\n- Default: `$HOME/.claude-tap-plus/.traces`\n- Extract project slug from: `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/uuid.jsonl`\n\n## 6. Backend Mode\n\n**Function signature:**\n```go\nfunc runBackend(args []string)\n```\n\n**Logger initialization:**\n```go\nlogDir := trace.DefaultTraceDir()\nif err := logger.Init(logDir, true, logger.DEBUG); err != nil {\n    log.Printf(\"warning: logger init failed: %v\", err)\n}\n```\n\n**Key differences:**\n- Always enables console output (`true`)\n- Always uses DEBUG level\n- Log dir based on DB path location\n\n## Additional Key Patterns\n\n**Subcommands:**\n- `session-push` - Collect sessions to local storage\n- `session-pull` - Restore sessions to ~/.claude/\n- `session-status` - Show session storage state\n- `backend` - Start backend server mode\n\n**Client configuration (ClaudeClient):**\n```go\nvar ClaudeClient = ClientConfig{\n    Cmd:              \"claude\",\n    BaseURLEnv:       \"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL\",\n    DefaultTarget:    \"https://api.anthropic.com\",\n    NestingEnvKeys:   []string{\"CLAUDECODE\", \"CLAUDE_CODE_SSE_PORT\"},\n    InjectSettingsEnv: true,\n}\n```\n\n**Settings injection (when used):**\n```go\nsettingsArgs := []string{\"--settings\", fmt.Sprintf(`{\"env\":{\"%s\":\"%s\"}}`, cfg.BaseURLEnv, proxyURL)}\n```"}],"totalDurationMs":119177,"totalTokens":78662,"totalToolUseCount":10,"usage":{"input_tokens":1466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":75221,"output_tokens":1975,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":8,"searchCount":2,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"tool_use_id":"call_33ef0262f36148e58c81ebfb","duration_ms":119177}
