}"},"tool_use_id":"call_9d0ae0ca702f4129af1500ff","tool_response":"The file D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\claude_tap_plus\\cmd\\claude-tap\\main.go has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]}
